entries.text:
Welcome to the Union Room.{VAR BE01}
If there is anything you need help with,
please let me know!{VAR BE01}

There are five Battle Formats.{VAR BE01}
Single Battle is for two Trainers
with one or more Pokémon each.{VAR BE01}
Each Trainer can have one Pokémon
in battle at a time.{VAR BE01}
Double Battle is for two Trainers
with two or more Pokémon each.{VAR BE01}
Each Trainer will send out two
Pokémon to battle at a time.{VAR BE01}
Triple Battle is for two Trainers
with three or more Pokémon each.{VAR BE01}
Each Trainer puts three Pokémon
into battle at one time.{VAR BE01}
Rotation Battle is for two Trainers.
Each Trainer sends three Pokémon{VAR BE00}
into battle, with one Pokémon in front{VAR BE00}
and the other two in back.{VAR BE01}
Multi Battle is for four Trainers
with one or more Pokémon each.{VAR BE01}
Each Trainer can have one Pokémon
in battle at a time.{VAR BE01}

You may trade your Pokémon with
other players.{VAR BE01}
Meeting new people could be a
shortcut to meeting rare Pokémon!{VAR BE01}

In a Spin Trade, each participant brings
an Egg to trade with others.{VAR BE01}
Which Egg will you end up with?
What kind of Pokémon is in that Egg?{VAR BE00}
It's quite exciting and fun!{VAR BE01}
Up to five players can take part,
so try it with your friends!{VAR BE01}

